window.products.push({"id":614015,"name":"Corner Shower Caddy, 1 Pack SUS304 Stainless Steel Wall Mounted Corner Shelf, Heavy Duty Aluminum Storage Organizer for Toilet and Kitchen (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Mzk62gcDL._AC_.jpg","description":"How to Use? 1.Clean the surface where you want to install the shelf.  2.Mark the installation location.  3.Apply the glue to the sticking area of the product.  4.Press the shelf on the installation position and fix it with the auxiliary adhesive tape.  5.Hang the shelf on the corner. You’d better put things on it after 24 hours.  6.Remove Guide: If you need to tear off adhesive, please use a hair dryer to heat the base, then it will be easy to tear down by a snap-off knife. Where to use: Widely used in Bathroom, Shower Room, Kitchen, Laundry Room, Toilet, Powder Table for Shampoo Combo, Conditioner, Towels, Duster, Kitchen Utensil and Cosmetics, etc.Please DON’T stick the shelf on painted walls or wallpapers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Mzk62gcDL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ConsWin","source_asin":"B07ZXFR6K4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-614015","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZXFR6K4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZXFR6K4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":614016,"name":"Alen 45i Air Purifier, Quiet Air Flow for Large Rooms, 800 SqFt, Air Cleaner for Allergens, Dust, Mold, Pet Odors with Long Filter Life","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":467.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fZ93-JfPS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Alen BreatheSmart 45i is ideal for medium, large, and extra-large sized spaces including living rooms, bedrooms, nurseries, laundry rooms, bathrooms, offices, kitchens, basements and more! The BreatheSmart 45i moves a lot of air efficiently, cleaning 800 SqFt every 30 minutes. Alen’s True HEPA Pure filter is best for capturing airborne allergens, dust, orders, pet smells, fur, bacteria, and mold spores. Equipped with a medical grade True HEPA H13 filter to capture 99.99% of airborne particles down to 0.1 micron. A laser smart sensor detects airborne particles and self-adjusts to address the challenges of your ever-changing environment. The 5 color LED display allows you to see your air quality at a glance. The BreatheSmart 45i is perfectly tuned for maximum airflow with minimum noise output to create a clean and peaceful environment. It has four fan speed options: the lowest produces such a small frequency, like a whisper. On the turbo fan setting the BreatheSmart 45i emits a frequency called pink noise which is a lower tone then the white noise and sounds like a gentle rainfall. The CFM (airflow in Cubic Feet per Minute) includes 4 speeds and noise levels; Speed 1: 53 CFM; Speed 2: 135 CFM; Speed 3: 147 CFM; Turbo: 187 CFM; Noise levels Speed 1: 39 dB (whisper); Speed 2: 42 dB (light rainfall); Speed 3: 49 dB (heavy rainfall); Turbo: 55 dB (medium box fan). Mix and match the colors in your house or use the BreatheSmart 45i to add that pop of color to accentuate your personal style. It is a sleek air purifier with a modern and stylish design to fit into any decor! It can be used in any space up to 800 Square Feet and has low energy consumption - 50 watts on Turbo speed. The lowest setting will use less than 50 cents a month in electricity. Includes: 1 BreatheSmart 45i Air Purifier, 1 HEPA-Pure Filter (Sku: B4-Pure), 1 Panel","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fZ93-JfPS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alen","source_asin":"B08QKRJJS1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-614016","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QKRJJS1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QKRJJS1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
