window.products.push({"id":614213,"name":"Plai Na Diffuser Reed Sticks Wooden for Aroma Essential Oil Decoration Room, 8 Inch Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kxWSYfZLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Package included 30 grams 8 inch diffuser reed sticks These tips will help you get the best out of your reed diffuser. If there is oil in the bottle but you still don’t get the fragrance, your reeds need to be changed. You could also add a couple of extra ones to emanate fragrance better. The diffusion of fragrance also largely depends on external factors like air conditioners, dehumidifiers, open doors and windows, which could impede the quality of fragrance in the room. If controlling these factors in not an option, you could place two reed diffusers in the same room in diagonal corners. If the fragrance diffuser is going to be placed in a smaller space, use fewer reeds, this will effectively ‘turn down the volume’ and keep the fragrance from being overpowering. Use containers with a narrow neck, this will prevent the oil from evaporating from the neck instead of being diffused from the top. Warm notice : 1. For best performance of your diffusers, change the reeds each time you change your diffuser oil. 2. Please keep these essential oil diffuser sticks in dry environment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kxWSYfZLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Plai Na","source_asin":"B085TQP7R3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-614213","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085TQP7R3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085TQP7R3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
