window.products.push({"id":614454,"name":"Rachael Ray Cucina 9.5 inch Soup And Pasta Bowls, Almond Cream, Set of 4 Bowls","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kWzer7SKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Savory soup and plentiful pasta is easy to enjoy when served in this set of four soup and pasta bowls from Rachael Ray's Cucina collection. Made from sturdy, solid stoneware and glazed with warm, modern rustic color, the generous soup and pasta bowl provides a handcrafted, antique look. The bowl is versatile, so you can enjoy mom's homemade chicken noodle soup or a new Italian recipe of your own. The bowl blends relaxed, rustic character with modern functionality. Oven safe up to 250 degrees Fahrenheit for 30 minutes to warm foods, the stoneware is also conveniently microwave, freezer and dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kWzer7SKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rachael Ray","source_asin":"B00WO47Y5E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-614454","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00WO47Y5E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00WO47Y5E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":614455,"name":"Berard Heart Shaped Bowl, 2-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JKM87wITL._AC_.jpg","description":"Since 1892, Berard has been a resource for kitchen tools and accessories using only the finest Mediterranean olive wood. Each piece is hand crafted by Artisans so no two pieces are exactly alike. Prized for its variations in characteristics, olive wood is naturally strong and elegant. The use of wood not only brings the beauty of nature indoors, but it has also been found to be more hygienic than plastic. Furthermore, out of respect for the environment, the particular olive wood used by Berard comes from sustainably managed forests, so the piece can be enjoyed for years to come and with peace of mind. Hand wash only and dry thoroughly. A light wipe of food safe mineral oil/beeswax can be used to restore the wood to its original luster Features: using traditional methods each piece is produced by artisans who are adept at working with wood. The unique nature of the wood means that no two pieces are alike and dimensions will vary from piece to piece. The little imperfections in the wood are characteristic of the hand crafted nature of each piece. The quality of Berard products are the result of century of know-how. Year after year, Berard has been synonymous with quality, authenticity and reliability. All olivewood items come from agricultural orchards and each tree is cut with respect to the laws that protect each country and the use of olive wood. Environment's Respect: Wood is a natural resource which is crucial to the balance of life on our planet. Using it as a raw material means respecting it from its origins. The forest or orchard, all the way through to recycling. On these issues, Berard's position is one of clarity and integrity: only species from forests and orchards which are managed in a sustainable manner are used. Respect of origin, strict management of quantities and careful selection of species are long-standing values at Berard.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JKM87wITL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bérard","source_asin":"B00I927ZU4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-614455","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00I927ZU4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00I927ZU4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
