window.products.push({"id":614458,"name":"16oz Amber Glass Beer Bottles for Home Brewing - 12 Pack with Flip Caps","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oOoKi4nTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HEAVY DUTY GLASS - Our 16 oz beer bottles are made with durable, thick amber glass. Perfect for homebrewing, Kombucha, whiskey bottling, soda, cider, kefir, vinegar, oil, vanilla extract, and more. PACKAGED SAFELY to prevent breakage during shipping. KEEPS CONTENTS FRESH - Our Flip Caps are made with sturdy steel and thick rubber gaskets to provide an airtight, leak proof seal, which conveniently preserves your homemade beverages, carbonation, and fermentation. UV AND BLUE LIGHT PROTECTED - Our amber colored bottles are ideal for filtering light and protecting your home brew, keeping quality in the contents of each and every bottle. COMPLETELY REUSABLE - Our durable glass beer bottles are built to last and dishwasher safe, so you and your loved ones can use and reuse them for years. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED - Barcaloo stands behind the quality and longevity of its products. If you have any issues, simply contact us and we will make it right!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oOoKi4nTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Barcaloo","source_asin":"B0BGYFL46Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-614458","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGYFL46Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGYFL46Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":614459,"name":"Dirt Devil BV2030RED Cordless Bagless Broom Vacuum Cleaner, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eit8tgKIS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Red broom vac sweeps and vacuums all hard floor surfaces in one simple sweep! Amazon.com Sweep up the kitchen floor in record time without repetitive bending with this lightweight broom vacuum from Dirt Devil. The 9.6-volt broom vacuum sucks up dirt and debris from hardwood and other bare floors with ample power, eliminating any need for a dustpan or the accompanying bending over. The cordless broom vacuum sucks up dirt through a 10-inch wide nozzle. Debris travels through a replaceable filter to collect in a dirt cup. The dirt cup removes from the broom vacuum with ease and is see-through for external fullness monitoring. A foot switch engages the broom vacuum's motor. To operate the broom vacuum, employ a standard sweeping movement. The broom vacuum is designed to tackle dry spills rather than puddles and soggy messes. Cordless in design, the vacuum eliminates tangled cords while providing endless range of movement. To recharge the unit, plug the unit into its adapter. For the best results and safety, read all enclosed material prior to use. Imported from Royal Appliance Mfg Co. in the United Kingdom, the broom vacuum necessitates some simple, tool-free assembly. Vacuum parts and the motor are both covered by one-year limited warranties. Upon shipping, the vacuum measures 21 by 13 by 4 inches and weighs approximately 5 pounds. --Jessica Reuling","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eit8tgKIS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dirt Devil","source_asin":"B0009I723G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-614459","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0009I723G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0009I723G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":614460,"name":"MitoVilla Black Boho Shower Curtain Set, Abstract Farmhouse Tassel Shower Curtain, Modern Geometric Fabric Standard Shower Curtain, Tribal Aesthetic S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811M2oK0ypL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Boho Farmhouse Design - The boho shower curtain in striking on a black and white striped design. Simple geometric pattern and boho tassel elements is also very eye pleasing, which is suitable for master bathroom, guest bathroom. Superior Quality Fabric - 160 GSM (g/m²) material, which means more heavy duty and last longer than other 120 GSM items in the market. So that it could keep in place. The quality curtain is elegant and soft, which can deliver a country-like bathroom environment. Metal Hooks - 12 free black metal hooks can match your shower curtain and reinforced top-header grommets to install easily. The 72 inches farmhouse shower curtain have 12 stainless metal grommet holes. Easy to Clean - The boho farmhouse fabric shower curtain is machine washable in cold water, dries quickly. Extra strong fabric and tight hem could avoid shrinkage and deformation. Warm Tips - The modern boho cloth shower curtain can resist water to some degree. Only a little bit of water will soak through, and most of the water will form water drops on the surface and quickly be repelled. Recommend using together with waterproof plastic shower curtain liner, If you pursue higher water resistance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811M2oK0ypL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MitoVilla","source_asin":"B092HGZK37","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-614460","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092HGZK37","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092HGZK37","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":614461,"name":"Royal Doulton Exclusively for Gordon Ramsay Maze Dark Grey Open Vegetable Bowl/Pasta Bowl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tEiYSWCIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Chilli Grey is added to the Gordon Ramsay Maze tableware collection ensuring home chefs can create the perfect setting. The Chilli Grey color allows a fun and zesty approach to table design and the Plate,s, bowls, mugs and serving sets can be mixed with exsisting Maze tableware in shades of white, soft blue, taupe, denim and teal, to make dynamic and very individual table settings to complement different lifestyles and home decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tEiYSWCIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Royal Doulton","source_asin":"B015HJH3X0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-614461","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015HJH3X0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B015HJH3X0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":614462,"name":"OXO Good Grips 6-Piece Plastic Measuring Spoons with Scraper- White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BOYuhUdpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The OXO Good Grips 7 Piece Measuring Spoons Set makes finding the right Spoon a snap. The unique snapping feature that keeps the Spoons together for storage also allows you to fan the Spoons out, so you can find the size you need on the first try. This feature also allows you to take out just the Spoon or Spoons you need, leaving the rest neatly snapped together. The Spoon handles have soft, comfortable, non-slip grips and color-coded, easy-to-read measurement markings. The Spoons also rest flat on the counter to prevent tipping and spilling. The Set includes a scraper that can be used to level ingredients, which also has a hook on it for hanging storage when needed. This dishwasher safe set includes a scraper, 1/8 tsp, 1/4 tsp, 1/2 tsp, 1 tsp, 1/2 T, 1 T Measuring Spoons.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BOYuhUdpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OXO","source_asin":"B0B85LJFZQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-614462","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B85LJFZQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B85LJFZQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
