window.products.push({"id":614563,"name":"NO MARK Japanese Samurai Poster The 7 Virtues of Bushido Samurai Prints Way of The Warrior Wall Art Poster Print with Changeable & Resuable Magnetic H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zdzyasHVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bushido originated in ancient Japan, which is based on the consciousness of risking one's life. In order to realize the value of individuals in the collective and the group, Bushido emphasizes \"death without consideration, death without scruple, and death without hesitation\". The most typical behavior of bushido spirit is incisive abdomen. There are several aspects: loyalty, righteousness, loyalty, loyalty and courtesy. \"Righteousness\" is the most strict instruction in the samurai code, which requires the warrior to abide by the righteousness and morality. \"Courage\" requires the warrior to have the spirit of daring and perseverance, as well as high-level martial arts. \"Benevolence\" makes Samurai not only become militarist warriors, but also has the virtues of tolerance, love, sympathy and compassion. \"Propriety\" is not only demeanor, but also the external expression of emotion and care for others. \"Honesty\" requires the samurai to be honest and to get rid of the temptation from the merchant class. The consciousness of \"reputation\" contains the dignity of personality and the consciousness of clear value. It requires that Samurai be willing to give everything for the sake of fame, and have the character of distinguishing right from wrong and maintaining patience and perseverance. \"Loyalty\" is of paramount importance. It is the link between people in all kinds of situations. Being loyal to one's master is the creed that a warrior must abide by. \"Self denial\" requires warriors to restrain their own selfish desires and not be influenced by desires. Only in this way can they serve the monarch and protect their neighbors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zdzyasHVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NO MARK","source_asin":"B08LSTM318","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-614563","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LSTM318","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LSTM318","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
