window.products.push({"id":614687,"name":"The Royal Gift Shop: Dark Brown Genuine Brazilian Extra Quality Agate Bookends - Home Decor (Dark Brown, 3-6 lbs)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91bVObi3SLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BRAZILIAN AGATE GEODES are sliced and polished to create natural bookends that show off the beauty of both the rough and polished stone. These bookends have two polished sides for each piece and a smooth cut base. Agate is excellent for balancing emotional and physical energy. Historically, it has been used in healing amulets and ornamentation dating back to Babylon. 'Agate' is the name given to numerous varieties of banded Chalcedony, a mineral of the quartz family. Usually banded in layers or stripes, some varieties have specks of color or fossilized inclusions, while others are solid. Dubbed a 'earth rainbow', the concentric bands of Agate form in nearly every color the earth can produce, including a colorless shade. SOME WIDELY ACCLAIMED BENEFITS OF AGATE: Promotes inner stability, composure, and maturity  Its warm, protective properties encourage security and self-confidence It is a great crystal to use during pregnancy, and also helps new mothers avoid the 'baby Blues' sometimes experienced after giving birth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91bVObi3SLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Royal Gift Shop","source_asin":"B06XTXQN2V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-614687","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XTXQN2V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XTXQN2V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
