window.products.push({"id":614697,"name":"OCNBLU Wine Cellar 34\" - 100L Beverage Refrigerator for 30 Bottles - Dual-Zone Drink Fridge with Cooling Fan, Touchpad Control, LED Display & Lights, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nfh1SNjhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for a way to properly store and chill your wines? Keeping your wines in a regular fridge isn't the ideal way of storing them. This is because the temperature there isn't suitable for wines since it's set for food preservation. This can make your wines too cold when served, which in turn can affect their quality and your level of enjoyment while you sip on them. What you need is a dedicated wine chiller. This is especially true whether you're planning to collect wines and store them for the long-term, or need to keep them chilled until your next get-together. Serve and enjoy perfectly chilled wines all the time with this Wine Cellar from OCNBLU. Setting the right temperatures for storing and chilling your wines is super easy with this mini wine fridge. The intuitive touch control panel is easy to use, and the LED display lets you see whether you're fridge is at the right temperature or needs to be adjusted. This dual-zone mini fridge for wines is designed with a key lock system so you can secure your treasured bottles. This way, you can keep your bottles of wines safe and away from your children's and everybody else's reach. Design your space the way you want to. This wine cellar has a reversible door hinge. This gives you more installation options and the flexibility you need to install the cooler even in irregularly shaped spaces or kitchens. Here are more details about our wine cellar: - Dimensions: 14.9 x 23 x 33.3 inches - Weight: 83.7 lbs. - Rated Voltage: 110V - Aluminum evaporator - CE, ERP, CB, RoHS,ETL Approved Keep your wines tasting great by keeping them at the right temperature. Add the OCNBLU Wine Cellar to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nfh1SNjhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OCNBLU","source_asin":"B091GJTXCH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-614697","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091GJTXCH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091GJTXCH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
