window.products.push({"id":614771,"name":"Kitchen Mat Set, 2 Pieces Floor mats Non-Slip Rubber Back Waterproof Kitchen Rugs Indoor Outdoor Doormats Bathroom Runner(18\" x 30\"+18\" x 47\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91f2bFqGesL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RELIEVE FOOT FATIGUE: This kitchen floor mat was made of high quality PVC leather,10mm Low rebound foaming and surface texture can help you relieve your foot fatigue. Designed with the highest-grade materials, our extra thick mats were ergonomically engineered to keep you comfortable while standing for prolonged periods of time. WATERPROOF AND OIL PROOF: The surface of the washable PVC mat is waterproof and oil proof, it can withstand spills or kitchen disasters. Stain resistant and easy to maintain and clean. Beautiful surface pattern design will provide a warm and bright accent for any home. NON SLIP BACKING: The mat’s unique beveled edges help to prevent tripping and slipping, and the foam underside helps keep the mat in place for minimal adjustments.The rubber non-slip latex rubber backing will improves safety preventing people from slipping or falling giving you that peace of mind, perfect for homes with pets (dogs or cats) or kids. Low profile design so doors won't get stuck. MULTIFUNCTIONAL UTILIZATION: :Comfort style with the large variety of beautiful colors and patterns offered! Complete with a beautifully textured top, our mats are sure to complement just about any individual and unique style. And you can free combine put in your kitchen,also suitable for doormat, bathrooms, bedrooms, kid's room, laundry rooms, restaurant, hotel, banquet, wedding party, home, outdoor activities and more. EASY TO CLEAN:Waterproof material make this anti fatigue mat easy to clean, just wipe it with wet cloth. Due to the kitchen rugs are a print, and try not to rub clean with sharp things, it will fade.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91f2bFqGesL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"famibay","source_asin":"B07PP13RDL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-614771","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PP13RDL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PP13RDL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
