window.products.push({"id":614885,"name":"Stock Your Home Gallon Glass Jar with Metal Lid (2 Pack) - 128 Ounce - Airtight & Odor Proof - Pickling & Canning Jars for Kombucha, Sun Tea, Fruits -","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DVHQnUxEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Proudly Made in the USA: Made of premium quality, lead-free glass material, our gallon big jars are perfect for brewing, pickling, fermentation, canning, storing dried goods, and more! Our value pack comes with 2 large glass jars and 2 110mm metal lids. Each jar has a capacity of 128 ounces. Jar measures approximately 10” Height. Airtight Metal Lid: Our metal lids are constructed with a non-removable plastisol liner to create a leak-proof, airtight seal. Our lids have ridges on the side to make unscrewing and securing the lid easy. The wide mouth (110mm) makes it easy for you to remove contents from the jars, and provides enough space to keep a scoop for dispensing candy and snacks. Dishwasher Safe Canning Jars: Our big jars are dishwasher safe and even easy to clean by hand. Simply wash with warm water, mild dish soap and a non-abrasive sponge to get your jars squeaky clean! You’ll never have to worry about our big mason jars warping from heat like cheap plastic containers. They’re also stain and odor resistant. You can be sure that our jars will last for years to come. Multipurpose: Our gallon jars can be used to store dried goods like rice, pasta, sugar, flour, and oats. Use them to brew kombucha, sun tea, iced tea, or cold-brew coffee. They’re great for pickling cucumbers, kimchi, red beets, and eggs. Our jars are also versatile for canning tomato sauce, barbecue sauce, buttermilk, mayonnaise, and more. You can even repurpose our jars as a terrarium for gardening and indoor plants. The possibilities are endless! Eco-Friendly: Our crystal clear giant mason jars are a great alternative to acrylic and plastic containers. Unlike plastic, our jars won’t leach BPA or phthalates into your food. Our jars are also recyclable and reusable. By using our large glass jars you’ll help reduce toxic emissions, overall benefiting the environment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DVHQnUxEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stock Your Home","source_asin":"B09CHNQ1M3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-614885","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CHNQ1M3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CHNQ1M3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
