window.products.push({"id":614951,"name":"Home Office Chair,Desk Chair with Folding and Breathable Mesh Mid Back Adjustable Height Flip Up Arms Ergonomic Back Lumbar Support Comfortable Soft C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A+4BkQmJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Folding Backrest to Save Space】The mesh office chair comes with 90°foldable backrest.The minimum height of the foldable office chair is only 62cm. 90°foldable backrest allows you to easily place the folding desk chair completely under desk, which does not occupy the channel space. The invisible office chair saves you more space,especially suitable for small space home offices. 【Fast Assemble in 5 Minutes】This mesh home office chair is very easy to assemble within 5 minutes as our office chair back,armrest and seat 3 parts arrived in 1 piece.No need other people's help,any one can assemble it very fast with just the allen key(come in package),save your time instead of complicated assemble steps. 【Flip up Arms Flexible Adjustment】:Byroras most comfortable office chair with flip up arms, which can be flipped up to save space, perform as a convenient armless office chair or be flipped down for resting arms.Rocking mechanism with tilt tension adjustment knob,8cm up and down gas lift cylinder for seat height adjustment, 360°rotation and free movement nylon casters. 【Ergonomic Backrest Mesh Office Chair】Featured with high density mesh back, not only fit the curve of your spine, but can be strongly supportive. Ergonomic backrest fit the natural curve of the lower back and take the pain of spinal away from your body. By simply turn tilt tenshion left and right to adjust rocking mechanism,memory foam office chair is easy to relax after long time working. 【Strong & Durable】:Mid back office chair with heavy duty seat plate and strong steel gas lift,lift up and down test 120,000 times, The maximum load-bearing capacity of the compact office chair is 150KG.Smooth, quiet, and scratch-free nylon wheels suitable for different floors.It is suitable for work or rest in living rooms, meeting rooms and offices. 【Good Quality and 1 Year Warranty】：Byroras is committed to providing high-quality mens womens office chairs.We also offer 1-year warranty. If you have any quality problem, please feel free to contact us immediately, we will provide you with a 100% satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A+4BkQmJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BYRORAS","source_asin":"B0922L3M44","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-614951","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0922L3M44","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0922L3M44","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":614952,"name":"CDCASA Power Lift Recliner Chair for Elderly, Faux Leather Electric Chairs with Heat and Massage,USB Ports,Remote Control,Side Pocket, Reclining Chair","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7199B24epgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💺【Comfortable And Durable Upholstery】 - Overstuffed backrest and seat cushion will bring you more comfortable, just like the whole body is wrapped up in chair. Soft and smooth faux leather provides a warm and soft feeling, Which is functional for optimal comfort, Extending footrest and reclining feature of this lazy boy recliner allows you to fully stretch and relax, like reading, sleeping, watching TV and so on. 💺【Power Lift Assistance】 - Our powerful and UL approved silent lift motor, have better performance, the more quiet operation, longer service lifespan.Our lift chair can pushes the entire chair up to help the senior stand up easily without adding stress to back or knees. Our lift recliner chair reclines up to 160 degrees,smoothly adjust to lift or reclining position you prefer by pressing two buttons on the remote control, which is easy to operate for people of all ages. 💺【Heated Vibration Massage】 - This chair come with 8 powerful vibration motors,4 custom zone settings and 5 modes. In addition, there are timing of remote control and waist heating functions.Through vibration and heat to achieve massage effect , making you feel relaxed.Armrests are equipped with side pockets, which is convenient. Extra USB charging port will allow you charging your Low Power devices during you sitting or reclining. 💺【Non-toxic Material】 - We insist on choosing environmentally friendly timber with higher production costs. All wood boards used in our products are formaldehyde-free, conform to the P2 Requirement of California Air Resources Board(CARB). We committed to protect the health of the elderly who chooses our electric lift chair. 💺【Easy Assembly and Good Customer Service】 - The recliner comes in 2 boxes and we provide a detailed instruction with numbered steps. Super easy assemble and usually only need 10-15mins to finish the installation, no tools required. We also provide 1 year technical support for the lift motor tand steel frame. If any shipping damage when it arrive or defective during usage, please feel free to contact us, we will provide the best after-sales service!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7199B24epgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CDCASA","source_asin":"B09M77WN1N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-614952","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09M77WN1N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09M77WN1N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
